    given-names: Ruge
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-20
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/GoGoKo699/Entanglement-Trajectories"
url: "https://quantum-journal.org/papers/q-2024-03-14-1282/"
abstract: >-
  Corrected computational companion and follow-up evidence package for the
  entanglement-trajectory representation. The repository provides exact
  Schmidt-spectrum metric envelopes, majorization-aware metric comparisons,
  deterministic quantum-chaos trajectories, random-matrix reference
  diagnostics, and quantified metric-robust trajectory morphology.
keywords:
  - quantum entanglement
  - Schmidt spectrum
  - entanglement trajectory
  - entanglement spectrum
  - majorization
  - quantum chaos
  - Renyi entropy
  - logarithmic negativity
  - random matrix theory
  - reproducible research
